To measure from block (a whole number) at opening (a whole number) with closing (a whole number).
Set base to 0.
For every before from 0 to block minus 1.
The otherleft is item before of lefts.
The otherright is otherleft plus item before of sizes.
If otherleft is less than closing and opening is less than otherright.
Set candidate to item before of tops.
If candidate is more than base, set base to candidate.

The last is the last position of lefts.
The best is 0.
For every block from 0 to last.
The front is item block of lefts.
The back is front plus item block of sizes.
